<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wells-Gardner cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wells-Gardner cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- National Securities analyst Steven Kornfeld said he downgraded Wells-Gardner Electronics Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the maker of open-frame video monitors were off 1/4 to 3-1/2.</p>
<p>-- &quot;While we remain optimistic about the company's long-term prospects, WGA has not achieved our profit targets,&quot; Kornfeld said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
